Configure these variables in Apache, PHP-FPM, or the hosting environment:

ALBA_STOCK_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=notifications@example.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_PORT=587
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_ENCRYPTION=tls
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_USERNAME=notifications@example.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-secret
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_FROM=notifications@example.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_FROM_NAME=ALBA-STOCK

Do not commit real credentials. The notification recipient is deliberately
configured separately from super-administrator account addresses.
